    {
      "id": "FDwhN8BS_HZy_GqYUNufH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 552.3809814453125,
      "y": -204.60317789309966,
      "width": 908.5997314453125,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1429777123,
      "version": 391,
      "versionNonce": 889256717,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731424524484,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Till Now we have studied how to make backend in Express ,\nMiddleware,Validation,router,Mongodb as database plus \nmongodb driver for our server to communicate with Database \n\nBut now it's time to study Mongoose and why we should use \nmongoose instead of native mongodb driver.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Till Now we have studied how to make backend in Express ,\nMiddleware,Validation,router,Mongodb as database plus \nmongodb driver for our server to communicate with Database \n\nBut now it's time to study Mongoose and why we should use \nmongoose instead of native mongodb driver.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R5geJxiCQU9faU44sT-bt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 536.9841557356419,
      "y": 112.69849592541846,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1970094499,
      "version": 395,
      "versionNonce": 1790546477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731446011003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mongoose:So mongoose is nodejs ODM for mongodb ,hmm now what is a odm basically?\n\nODM stands for Object Data Modeling Or also know as Object Document Mapper which\nbasically works as a appilaction interface b/w server and database  that helps\nmanage data in a more structured way and Object oriented .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mongoose:So mongoose is nodejs ODM for mongodb ,hmm now what is a odm basically?\n\nODM stands for Object Data Modeling Or also know as Object Document Mapper which\nbasically works as a appilaction interface b/w server and database  that helps\nmanage data in a more structured way and Object oriented .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bdu-mElpmPB1xjxW5F89P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 542.2222532645739,
      "y": 289.3650608668247,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1502043395,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 1226021261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731444698044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.Modeling:An ODM allows you to define schemas for our data models .\nthese schemas define the structure of our document \nlike the field they have ,what types those field are,\nand any validation rules to apply",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Modeling:An ODM allows you to define schemas for our data models .\nthese schemas define the structure of our document \nlike the field they have ,what types those field are,\nand any validation rules to apply",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PdYLANwlHaavZWcOQooII",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541.5873195506914,
      "y": 441.58734377099046,
      "width": 649,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1479352675,
      "version": 167,
      "versionNonce": 1398749325,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731444771912,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.Abstraction:It abstracts the actual database interaction,\nso we can work with high level object instead of \ndealing with raw database queries",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.Abstraction:It abstracts the actual database interaction,\nso we can work with high level object instead of \ndealing with raw database queries",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZFxxtPKNTdHxpkARbd7LM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541.9047893746191,
      "y": 582.2222241396628,
      "width": 683,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1564825283,
      "version": 227,
      "versionNonce": 1652699309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731446162288,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.Convenience:Provide methods to easily perform CRUD operation\nlike create,read,update and delete ,handle data relationships\nand perform data validations",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.Convenience:Provide methods to easily perform CRUD operation\nlike create,read,update and delete ,handle data relationships\nand perform data validations",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y44RaVEAa4W6MN3DdwO1M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540.0000347359472,
      "y": 749.5238716892471,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 897952109,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 521665859,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731446204230,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mongoose is a popular Node.js/Deno library for MongoDB.\nIt provides a straightforward, schema-based solution to \nmodel your application data and includes built-in type \ncasting, validation, and query building.\n\nHere's a quick overview of how to get started \nwith Mongoose:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mongoose is a popular Node.js/Deno library for MongoDB.\nIt provides a straightforward, schema-based solution to \nmodel your application data and includes built-in type \ncasting, validation, and query building.\n\nHere's a quick overview of how to get started \nwith Mongoose:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
