      "text": "Connects server to Mongo but with connection \nstring we also have to add the database name\nunlike Native MongoDB driver where we do \ncleint.db(dbName) to get connection with client",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Connects server to Mongo but with connection \nstring we also have to add the database name\nunlike Native MongoDB driver where we do \ncleint.db(dbName) to get connection with client",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
