      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731501326900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In mongoDB driver we need to fetch out \na MongoClient instance but in mongoose we dont need\nto fetch out a Mongo instance instead we apply\nmethod directly onto mongoose function of mongoose \nlibraray plus unlike Mongodb driver where we access database\nusing client.db() or .db() method in mongoose we pass database\nname into the mongoose as url with connection string ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In mongoDB driver we need to fetch out \na MongoClient instance but in mongoose we dont need\nto fetch out a Mongo instance instead we apply\nmethod directly onto mongoose function of mongoose \nlibraray plus unlike Mongodb driver where we access database\nusing client.db() or .db() method in mongoose we pass database\nname into the mongoose as url with connection string ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
