      "updated": 1731523648197,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here in update one the reason we didnt use a $set operator is because \nwe are working with single field if there were two or more field we would \nhave use $set operator to set those field value or else it will create a whole new \ndocument with just that field which we provided:\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
